{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/GIF_Header.gif?t=1746105617\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/Description_Header_Concept.png?t=1746105617\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LHEA awakens in the <strong>In-Between</strong>, a dreamy world between life and death. Mentored by an ancient Word Spirit, help her master an innovative timeline battle system and guide lost souls in this <strong>charming single-player roguelite adventure</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/Description_Header_GameLoop.png?t=1746105617\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> the realms, <strong>learn </strong>knowledge,  <strong>optimize</strong> your Fate Flute and <strong>battle</strong> entities to seal the realms and restore balance in the In-Between!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/GIF_Realms.gif?t=1746105617\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/Description_Header_Features.png?t=1746105617\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TIMELINE BATTLE SYSTEM</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate and optimize the battle timeline to your advantage. Every decision matters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FATE FLUTE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip and upgrade up to 9 enchanted rings across 3 customizable presets, each granting the ability to cast knowledge spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/GIF_Flute.gif?t=1746105617\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KNOWLEDGE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the realms to discover their hidden knowledge, gain powerful spells and unlock special features that will help you conquer the In-Between.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>REALM MAPS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is different! Adapt your strategy to challenges and surprises you encounter in the procedurally generated realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/GIF_Map.gif?t=1746105617\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AND MUCH MORE...!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It would ruin the fun a bit if everything was revealed on this page! :) Find out how to optimize your runs and complete your objectives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>May the stars align in your favor!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/Description_SFG.png?t=1746105617\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About SOUL FUEL GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Created in 2023 by solo developer Jo Drolet, Soul Fuel Games aims to create video games filled with LIGHT and unpredictability. LHEA and the Word Spirit is the first game of this new studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Head over to their website or give them a follow on social media to stay in touch and receive updates about LHEA or future games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>We appreciate you &lt;3</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><